<view class="page"><view class="headline"><text>创投资讯</text><text>关注市场、政策与 BP 安全流转，为每一次对接补足背景信息。</text></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="filters"><text wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="filter {{activeCategory === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-category="{{item}}" bindtap="chooseCategory">{{item}}</text></scroll-view><view class="article card" wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openArticle"><view class="article-top"><text class="tag">{{item.category}}</text><text class="muted">{{item.publishedAt}}</text></view><text class="article-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="summary">{{item.summary}}</text><text class="read-more">阅读全文 →</text></view></view>
